per-thread codex hook auto-registrations accumulate forever (every codex exec conversation leaves an unknown-liveness registry row). Need GC: deregister on codex SessionEnd hook if available, else TTL sweep for unknown-liveness codex-* rows idle >N hours (careful: sweep is dangerous for live sessions, prefer SessionEnd + lazy expiry on read)
